//│ ╟── Parameter 'x' admits values of unknown shape.
//│ ║  l.6: 	fun read(x) = x.value
//│ ║       	         ^
//│ ╟── 'read' is exposed by this compilation unit.
//│ ║  l.6: 	fun read(x) = x.value
